Package: regcore
Title: S3 Generic Functions for Regression Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Ricardo Rasmussen", "Petterle", email = "ricardopetterle@ufpr.br",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7735-1077"))
Description: Defines S3 generic functions for model comparison, coefficient
    summaries, goodness-of-fit tables, equation extraction, random-effects
    summaries, diagnostic plots, variable selection, and methods reporting.
    Model-specific implementations are supplied by packages that extend these
    interfaces, allowing a consistent workflow across regression models.
